abstract: >-
  The OntoUML JSON2Graph Decoder transforms JSON documents
  compliant with the OntoUML Schema, including documents
  exported by the OntoUML Visual Paradigm plugin, into RDF
  graphs compliant with the OntoUML Vocabulary. It supports
  model-only and full-project decoding, deterministic resource
  identifiers, configurable handling of malformed or
  unrepresentable source constructs, and optional
  transformation provenance metadata.
